This repository ships two kinds of work under two different licenses:

  - The CODE is MIT-licensed (see "Code license" below).
  - The TEXTBOOK CONTENT is CC BY-SA 4.0 (see "Content license" below).

When in doubt about which a file is:
    Under src/, tests/, configuration, build scripts, or documentation
    describing the codebase → code (MIT).

    Under .cache/docs/, src/data/*/glossary/, or any rendered textbook
    output (PDFs, audio) → content (CC BY-SA 4.0).

